<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Grand Crime Life</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#080808;color:#fff}
.hero{min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;padding:30px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 20%,#3a1515 0,#120909 35%,#050505 75%)}
.card{max-width:850px;width:100%;padding:45px 25px;border:1px solid #5c2424;border-radius:24px;background:rgba(10,10,10,.78);box-shadow:0 20px 70px #000}
.badge{display:inline-block;padding:8px 15px;border-radius:30px;background:#b51d1d;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px}
h1{font-size:clamp(42px,10vw,88px);margin:22px 0 8px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:3px;text-shadow:0 5px 20px #000}
p{color:#c9c9c9;font-size:18px;line-height:1.6}
.btn{display:inline-block;margin-top:20px;padding:15px 28px;border-radius:12px;background:#d52222;color:white;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold}
.btn:hover{background:#ef3333}
.features{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:14px;margin-top:35px}
.feature{padding:20px;border-radius:15px;background:#151515;border:1px solid #292929}
.feature b{display:block;font-size:18px;margin-bottom:7px}
.small{font-size:13px;color:#888;margin-top:28px}
footer{padding:20px;text-align:center;color:#777;background:#050505}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<section class="hero">
  <div class="card">
    <span class="badge">COMING 2027</span>
    <h1>Grand Crime Life</h1>
    <p>Enter the city. Build your story. Explore a huge open world full of missions, vehicles, characters and action.</p>
    <a class="btn" href="#" onclick="alert('APK download link will be added when the game is released!');return false;">DOWNLOAD APK</a>
    <div class="features">
      <div class="feature"><b>🌆 Open World</b><span>Explore the city and discover new places.</span></div>
      <div class="feature"><b>🎯 Missions</b><span>Complete missions and create your own story.</span></div>
      <div class="feature"><b>🚗 Vehicles</b><span>Drive around the city and enjoy the ride.</span></div>
      <div class="feature"><b>🎮 3D Adventure</b><span>A crime-life inspired 3D game experience.</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="small">Official game website • APK link coming soon</div>
  </div>
</section>
<footer>© 2027 Grand Crime Life. All rights reserved.</footer>
</body>
</html>
